Vercel v0 clone example
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

LessonPlay is a separately developed T3 application. Vercel's v0 clone example
was used as a frontend reference, and selected UI implementation was adapted
from it. Retained portions include the application shell, chat menus, prompt
presentation, and AI Elements primitives under `src/components/`.

Reference source:
    https://github.com/vercel/v0-sdk/tree/76f01009d0cdc180a79e25d238e422b575c72acc/examples/v0-clone

    Copyright 2025 Vercel, Inc.
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The Apache terms are retained in `third-party/APACHE-2.0.txt` at the repository
root. This attribution applies to retained Vercel-derived UI portions. It does
not describe LessonPlay's custom authentication, agent, sandbox, or publishing
workflows as Vercel code, and does not grant a project-wide Apache license.

